\title{Timugon Murut Language Resources for K-12 Curriculum Development}
\author{Compiled by Claude Sonnet 5 (claude-sonnet-5) for Andr\'as Kornai}
\date{}
\begin{document}
\maketitle

\section{Introduction}
Timugon Murut (ISO 639-3: tih) is an Austronesian language of Sabah, Malaysia. Sources disagree on speaker numbers (about 7,000 in the survey description; about 15,000 on Webonary; fewer than 10,000 in a news report). Two main dialects, Poros and Kapagalan, are described, with the related Beaufort Murut (Binta'). No school programme in the language was found. The best resource is the online dictionary.

\section{Primary Educational Resources}
No primers, textbooks or school materials were found in the searches.

\section{Linguistic and Reference Materials}
\begin{itemize}
\item Timugon Murut--Malay dictionary on Webonary (about 22,600 Timugon entries; also pages on phonology, grammar and bibliography): \url{https://www.webonary.org/timugon_murut/overview/}
\item Webonary introduction (dialects, compilers' notes): \url{https://www.webonary.org/timugon_murut/en/overview/introduction/}
\item Webonary phonology page: \url{https://www.webonary.org/timugon_murut/language/phonology/}
\item Austronesian Basic Vocabulary Database wordlist: \url{https://abvd.eva.mpg.de/austronesian/language.php?id=22}
\end{itemize}

\section{Religious and Community Resources}
No scripture or community organisation was found in the searches. A news report says language activists put the dictionary online; it also mentions a 2004 printed dictionary begun by Richard and Kielo Brewis: \url{https://fmtv5.freemalaysiatoday.com/category/nation/2026/01/02/language-activists-put-timugon-murut-dictionary-online}

\section{Digital and Audio Resources}
The Webonary dictionary is the only digital resource found. No audio or video was found.

\section{Curriculum Development Context}
The dictionary offers a vocabulary base, but a curriculum would need new primers, texts and orthography decisions. Little else exists in the sources found.

\end{document}
